    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present 96 Biscayne, Malahide to the market, a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached family home with a garage, a generous rear garden, and an enviable position within this mature and highly sought-after coastal development.\r\n\r\nBiscayne has long been regarded as one of Malahide’s most established residential locations, offering an excellent combination of mature surroundings, generous family homes, and convenient access to both Malahide Village and the coast.\r\n\r\nNo. 96 offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 113 m², in addition to an adjoining garage. The property has been very well maintained over the years and, while the interior would now benefit from some modernisation, it provides an excellent opportunity for a new owner to create a superb family home tailored to their own style and requirements.\r\n\r\nThe ground-floor accommodation comprises an entrance porch and hallway, a particularly impressive living room extending to approximately 7.75 metres in length, kitchen/dining room, guest WC, and an adjoining garage. The living room is a notable feature of the property, offering excellent proportions and a wonderful sense of space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four bedrooms, including a generously sized primary bedroom, together with the main family bathroom. The two rear bedrooms enjoy stunning sea views, with beautiful outlooks across the sea towards Lambay Island. There is also a generous storage room adjoining the fourth bedroom, offering excellent potential to be incorporated into the existing accommodation to create a larger bedroom with en-suite.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a large, mature and private garden, offering an excellent outdoor space for families, gardening, and entertaining. The property also benefits from a sizeable driveway to the front providing ample off-street parking, together with an integral garage offering valuable storage and further potential, subject to any necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe house has also benefited from a number of important upgrades, including triple-glazed windows throughout, a replacement front door, and gas-fired central heating, adding to the comfort of the home.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional. Malahide Village, with its excellent selection of restaurants, cafés, boutiques and everyday amenities, is within easy reach, while the beautiful coastline and coastal walks towards Portmarnock are also close by. Malahide Castle and Demesne, excellent schools, sporting facilities, and transport connections, including Malahide DART Station, are all readily accessible.\r\n\r\n96 Biscayne represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a substantial four-bedroom family home in one of Malahide’s most established residential neighbourhoods, with excellent space, a garage, a generous garden, and considerable potential for the next owner to put their own stamp on the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nPorch - 1.85m x 1.08m\r\nHall - 1.84m x 4.59m\r\nLiving Room - 3.54m x 7.75m\r\nKitchen / Dining Area - 4.38m x 3.04\r\nDownstairs WC - 1.21m x 1.04m\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.43m x 4.05m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.42m x 3.60m\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.42m x 3.04m\r\nBedroom 4 – 2.27m x 2.67m\r\nStorage Room – 2.41m x 4.60m\r\nGarage 2.36m x 4.59m (not included in size of property)"
